mechanically trimmed, otherwise unmodified source fork of
`github.com/ncruces/go-sqlite3` v0.32.0. The exact upstream commit, module
checksums, retained package boundary, and local replacement are recorded in
`runtime/third_party/go-sqlite3/UPSTREAM.md`. Its complete selected Go module
graph is:

